// During partial conversion, an op that was rewritten to memref feeds into an unconverted op still expecting tensor.
// The Dialect Conversion driver inserts an `unrealized_conversion_cast` at the boundary and asks the
// TypeConverter for a materialization to legalize the cast into a real op.

// Example boundary insertion (pre-materialization):
%m0 = memref.alloc() : memref<Nxf32>
// ... writes into %m0 via new memref-based ops ...
%t0 = builtin.unrealized_conversion_cast %m0 : memref<Nxf32> to tensor<Nxf32>

// Materialization (via `addTargetMaterialization` inserting bufferization.to_tensor):
%t0 = bufferization.to_tensor %m0 : memref<Nxf32>
